source_proof = "The module checks README architecture and recovery guidance against the embedded host and consensus source; parses the actual curl argument vector and JSON-RPC payload and checks root-path dispatch and chain-ID production; parses the hosted OpenRPC method contract and checks native registrations separately; follows real send acceptance/forwarding, WAL acknowledgement before publication, receipt rungs, committed coverage, JSON fields and key-pinned signature verification sources; checks custody/checkpoint refusal guards and the merged node build/start targets. These are source assertions on production paths, not emulated node execution."
