evidence = "The final hf-done JSON and private /out/run/gates.jsonl record the exact verified content-derived revision, command, exit code and log path. Build and verify must pass on the same candidate revision. This record is finalized before qualification; inserting a candidate hash into its own content would change that hash. The runner retains declared evidence and publishes the task; no manual commit or push is performed."
